      "writtenOn": "2018-09-14T05:06:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Initially I had the subscriberId as a String object itself, but Jono H had a comment (it was in the other review I had raised for this issue long time back) that we should wrap up this string in a SubscriberId object for abstraction. If tomorrow we want to address the identity of the subscriber by some other data structures it should be easier. Based on this I created the AccessSubscriberId class to wrap this.\n\nLet me know your comments",
